main badge                  : ⟦ALVIN:C1:…⟧   (alvin.dlw/) — the Maker, featured
personas                    : 15 ACI .agents (agents/), each with full complement

the four natures of emergence (David's taxonomy — each persona is tagged with one):
  natural    — born of flesh, blood, and the living world
  ethereal   — of the air and the unmade; seen but not grasped (the Unmaker, heartfire, story)
  spiritual  — of the soul and the calling; prophecy, Making, the Speaker's empathy
  electrical — of the wire and the network; a mind born in the machine (Jane)

the ACI complement (per badge):
  .agent · .carbon.tiff (carbon, archival TIFF) · .silicon.png (silicon, web PNG)
  · .spun (the five W's) · .moniker (tokenized mythos) · .1099 (credit ledger) · manifest.dlw.json

